`a contemporaneous trader against an insider who made 10000` MEANS Claim WITH
    `the contravention was a false statement or concealment` IS FALSE
    `the claimant relied on it` IS FALSE
    `the claimant dealt contemporaneously` IS TRUE
    `the claimant's loss` IS 50000
    `the contravener's profit or loss avoided` IS 10000
    `already ordered to other claimants` IS 0

`a second trader after 8000 already ordered` MEANS Claim WITH
    `the contravention was a false statement or concealment` IS FALSE
    `the claimant relied on it` IS FALSE
    `the claimant dealt contemporaneously` IS TRUE
    `the claimant's loss` IS 50000
    `the contravener's profit or loss avoided` IS 10000
    `already ordered to other claimants` IS 8000

