§ `s 197`

#ASSERT `the conduct contravenes section 197` `a trader who painted the tape to lure buyers`
#ASSERT `the conduct contravenes section 197` `a wash trade between two accounts of the same owner`
#ASSERT NOT `the conduct contravenes section 197` `a wash trade the owner proved was for tax reasons`
#ASSERT `the conduct contravenes section 197` `a large order reckless as to its effect on the price`
#ASSERT NOT `the conduct contravenes section 197` `a large order that moved the price unforeseeably`

